00:29:42.090 --> 00:29:44.890
<v Mike>All right, so let's see.

00:29:45.370 --> 00:29:46.410
<v Mike>Cinematic intent?

00:29:47.170 --> 00:29:48.210
<v Sean>Cinematic intent.

00:29:48.590 --> 00:29:50.670
