00:31:40.290 --> 00:31:41.610
<v Mike>compare this game to some other games?

00:31:41.690 --> 00:31:43.470
<v Mike>Because we're doing a great job.

00:31:43.470 --> 00:31:47.590
<v Sean>I will say that you are mischaracterizing how I said Gradius.

